; The classifier tail for the pure engine: softmax + top-k over the packed
; tensors [Native_interp.run] returns.
;
; Deliberately depends on neither [pt2] nor [native_interp], even though its only
; caller composes it with both. It is pure math over [Tensor.packed], so keeping
; the composition at the executable leaves this testable with hand-built tensors
; and no archive -- which is what lets the numerical cases (underflow ordering,
; large-logit stability, full-class normalization) exist at all.

(library
 (name native_predict)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries err_trace fmt native))
